{
  "executive_summary": "E2E Driver planned and taught a clear, well-sequenced lesson on proper fractions; the strongest area was Lesson Plan Fidelity (clear tasks, real-world example). The teacher reflected that pacing worked well and intends to give quieter students more time to answer. The key growth area is Differentiation — most activity was whole-class and identical for all students, so adding a simple tiered task and brief think-time will increase engagement and learning.",
