        "id": "D1",
        "name": "Diversity of Conceptual Expression",
        "score": 2,
        "evidence": "Students express the concept in multiple, different phrasings beyond simple choral repetition: early identification \"یہ سرکل ہے.\" (\"This is a circle.\") [00:34] and later conceptual phrasing about fractions: [08:44] \"جو کلر کیا ہوا ہے، وہ اوپر ہے، اور ٹوٹل نیچے ہے.\" (\"The coloured part is on top and the total is below.\"). These are distinct student phrasings of the idea.",
